ns in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=si4JFC2yjRYQ7kNvwGA6x89&_nc_oc=AdpwICl4gATh4NpAeDFhowlMeyIkhuSN6PWMwj0e5nxPjS0KJyTJWiallNjEgJhHJ0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKhQpIElQT13JoE0QhhCGfwDwGJt2I0ucvSCXjqGHDBaw&oe=6AA96303"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=09DrXZ8PScMQ7kNvwGc6RMf&_nc_oc=AdpHT717ENxZolyxT9_UHPEGvnCi0F6OR4FzRva9-KrDwrp75-QwgNcRMayytrAOK94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZFhvG_IWHsBXa2EWiVpAZ8wuSuKYb_K9ataCmWGOOaA&oe=6AA95B58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5HjFwUQZPiwQ7kNvwEo2CDk&_nc_oc=AdrphWCI97Paao31DvwtHqYxqW1YLH0N_AAAT1FG1GtSupsJSJMTTEcq9bNN4vQL4aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ9hsD6_9bKpOQWjy3u6MW5Y8dF_bxG1invX-y01dALOA&oe=6AA9363C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_13386805878482